# The title of the window names the document and marks unsaved changes.
# Needs -debug-qt-widgets: the checks are the "window title" lines of the
# log, which must read
#   window title: No name [<n>]        (the name TeXmacs gives a new buffer)
#   window title: No name [<n>] *      (after the first change)
# and never "TeXmacs" (the name the window was created with, kept because
# SLOT_NAME was not forwarded) nor " *" (the marker without the name).
wait 6000
window #2
wait 500
text Hello
wait 1500
